WEBVTT

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:30.136
I've overpowered his elite guard,

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:32.095
burst into his secret bunker

00:00:32.119 --> 00:00:33.936
with my machine gun ready.

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:35.856
He lunges for his Luger.

00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:37.696
I knock it out of his hand.

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:40.056
He lunges for his cyanide pill.

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:41.816
I knock that out of his hand.

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:43.136
He snarls,

00:00:43.160 --> 00:00:45.376
comes at me with otherworldly strength.

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:47.096
We grapple, we fight,

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:49.016
I manage to pin him down

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:50.600
and put on handcuffs.

00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:53.496
"Adolf Hitler," I say,

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:56.360
"I arrest you for crimes
against humanity."

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:00.976
Here's where the Medal of Honor
version of the fantasy ends